  "title": "Barak Tor: Barrow of the Witch Lord",
  "intro": {
    "summary": "A war with the orcs of the east is about to break out, and the King must bind the realm together before it starts. For that he needs the Star of the West, a jewel once worn by legendary rulers. It rests inside Barak Tor, the grave mound of the wicked Witch Lord. Ages ago a magic blade, the Spirit Blade, defeated him, and nothing else can wound him. Bring the Star back to the stairs and the King will give 200 gold coins, split evenly between the heroes."
