          "text": "Read aloud: the heroes have shattered the magic seal that bound the Witch Lord, and he is awake. Escape is their only hope, since just the Spirit Blade can wound him. Stand the Dread Sorcerer figure on the X square. No weapon and no spell touches him. He walks 1 square each turn and strikes with 2 attack dice. His spells are summon undead, fear, command and ball of flame."
